# Root build context
# Keep the context small and avoid leaking local data/secrets.

.git
.github
.gitignore
*.md
# Issue #1880: the generated third-party attribution files are copied into the
# image; every other markdown file stays out of the build context.
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES.md

# Node
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/build
frontend/coverage

# Go / backend local artifacts
backend/mycorrhizal
backend/tmp
backend/vendor
backend/*.db
backend/*.sqlite*
backend/**/*_test.go

# Local runtime data (do not bake into the image). The production Dockerfile
# creates its own data dirs inside the container and never copies these in.
data
photos

# Environment files / secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/my_environment.env

# Editor / OS cruft. The `**/` prefix matters: a bare `.DS_Store` only matches
# the one at the context root, so an untracked frontend/public/.DS_Store (or an
# editor dir anywhere in the tree) used to be copied into the image by stage 2's
# `COPY frontend/ .` and served publicly at /.DS_Store.
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
